=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
# system-details cli-flags -------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# The five flags origin/main parses and ignores$
# (pkg/cmd/system_details_cmd.go:38-42, the code using them$
# commented out at :95-121). What they become is §3.11's: not$
# approved, so this is a proposal.$
$
# Today --------------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  All five             Parsed and ignored$
$
# Proposed, if §3.11 is approved -------------------------------$
$
   -  --json$
      --output json, with a warning$
   -  -O json, --format json$
      --output json, with a warning$
   -  --yaml, -O yaml$
      Refused, exit 2$
   -  -O text$
      Accepted, with a warning$
   -  -S, --section$
      Refused, exit 2$
   -  -E, --export$
      Refused: use > file$
$
# Proposed, until §3.11 is decided -----------------------------$
$
   -  All five             Parsed and ignored, as today$
$
$

